OL,3,A'Get out now' officials warn as Isaias
OL,4,Abarrels toward US Gulf Coast with
OL,5,A'devastating' winds
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsaias has sustained winds of 120 mph
OL,8,F(195km/h), but has even higher gusts -
OL,9,Ftrack its path here
OL,11,F"Get out NOW!" warn some Florida
OL,12,Fofficials as they urge residents to
OL,13,Ffollow evacuation orders - see where
OL,14,Felse people are being asked to leave
OL,16,FStates of emergency have also been
OL,17,Fissued in parts of Alabama, Florida and
OL,18,Fin all of Georgia as they brace for
OL,19,Fheavy rain
